  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:330px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-goldenrod pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Formula Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/42/DC_Comics_Justice_League_Infinity_006_%282022%29_Amazo_absorbs_Anti_Life_Equation.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20220618130627\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"DC Comics Justice League Infinity 006 (2022) Amazo absorbs Anti Life Equation\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/42/DC_Comics_Justice_League_Infinity_006_%282022%29_Amazo_absorbs_Anti_Life_Equation.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20220618130627\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/42/DC_Comics_Justice_League_Infinity_006_%282022%29_Amazo_absorbs_Anti_Life_Equation.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20220618130627 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/42/DC_Comics_Justice_League_Infinity_006_%282022%29_Amazo_absorbs_Anti_Life_Equation.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20220618130627 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"DC Comics Justice League Infinity 006 (2022) Amazo absorbs Anti Life Equation\" width=\"270\" height=\"415\" data-image-key=\"DC_Comics_Justice_League_Infinity_006_%282022%29_Amazo_absorbs_Anti_Life_Equation.jpg\" data-image-name=\"DC Comics Justice League Infinity 006 (2022) Amazo absorbs Anti Life Equation.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Amazo II (DC Comics) was able to absorb the Anti-Life Equation and become an even more powerful entity that laid waste to its enemies.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb formulas.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb formulas/formulaic power and utilized them in some way</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Formula_Manifestation\" title=\"Formula Manifestation\">Formula Manifestation</a>. Scientific version of <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Absorption\" title=\"Spell Absorption\">Spell Absorption</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFormula_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Formula Assimilation</li>\n<li>Formulaic Power Absorption/Assimilation</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFormula_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb formulas/formulaic power, while removing it from the source, into their body and use it in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by <a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Condition\">enhancing</a> themselves, <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">gaining</a> the drained power, using it as <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Source\" title=\"Power Source\">power source</a>, etc., either temporarily or permanently.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFormula_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Regeneration\" title=\"Absorbing Regeneration\">Absorbing Regeneration</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Assimilation Shield\">Assimilation Shield</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Formula_Power_Link\" title=\"Formula Power Link\">Formula Power Link</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Formula_Empowerment\" title=\"Formula Empowerment\">Formula Empowerment</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mimetic_Regeneration\" title=\"Mimetic Regeneration\">Mimetic Regeneration</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Regenerative_Healing_Factor\" title=\"Regenerative Healing Factor\">Regenerative Healing Factor</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Physical_Augmentation\" title=\"Physical Augmentation\">Physical Augmentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Science_Mode\" title=\"Science Mode\">Science Mode</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFormula_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Formula_Manipulation\" title=\"Formula Manipulation\">Formula Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Formula_Manifestation\" title=\"Formula Manifestation\">Formula Manifestation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFormula_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li>\n<li>May be limit as to how much formulaic power can be absorbed.</li>\n<li>May damage user’s body without proper management.</li>\n<li>May only be able to absorb particular formula/formulaic power.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FFormula_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Amazo-II_(DCAU)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Amazo-II (DCAU)\">Amazo II</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Max_Faraday_(Wildstorm_Universe)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Max Faraday (Wildstorm Universe)\">Max Faraday</a> (<i>DC/WildStorm Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://generatorrex.fandom.com/wiki/Rex_Salazar\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:generatorrex:Rex Salazar\">Rex Salazar</a> (<i>Generator Rex</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://naruto.fandom.com/wiki/Kabuto_Yakushi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:naruto:Kabuto Yakushi\">Kabuto Yakushi</a> (<i>Naruto</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href